# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference material — NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working folder for raw Adelphi screenshots and exports used while authoring
# content. These contain real internal system structure and, in some cases,
# real personal data (names, AUIDs, directory attributes, group membership).
#
# Sanitised, fictional recreations belong in `public/reference/` and are the
# only images that may be committed. See docs/security.md.
/Screenshots/
/screenshots/
/reference/
*.raw.png
*.raw.pdf

